          "path": "_m/9/q/9/p/jack-london-square-wp/reconstruction-jack-lo.jpg",
          "filename": "Jlhut.jpg",
          "caption": "Reconstruction of Jack London's Yukon hut in Jack London Square, Oakland, California, USA.  An identical cabin exists in Dawson City, Yukon, Canada.  Since the original 1898 cabin, located in the Yukon wilderness, was of historical interest to both Canadians and Americans, a decision was made in the 1960s to build two identical cabins, each having half of the original logs: one to be erected in Oakland, the other in Dawson City.",
          "alt": "Reconstruction of Jack London's Yukon hut in Jack London Square, Oakland, California, USA.  An identical cabin exists in Dawson City, Yukon, Canada.  Since the original 1898 cabin, located in the Yukon wilderness, was of historical interest to both Canadians and Americans, a decision was made in the 1960s to build two identical cabins, each having half of the original logs: one to be erected in Oakland, the other in Dawson City.",
